python3-multiflexi for Debian

This package provides the MultiFlexi API client library for Python, enabling
developers to interact with the MultiFlexi API for job execution, application
management, and user data operations.

The package includes comprehensive API models and client classes generated by
the OpenAPI Generator from the MultiFlexi API specification.

Usage example:
  from multiflexi_client import Configuration, ApiClient, DefaultApi
  
For more examples and documentation, see the online API documentation.

